  "title": "习近平在辽宁沈阳市考察调研",
  "date": "2022-08-18 09:40:42",
  "author": "人民日报客户端",
  "editor": "唐宋",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n\t17日下午，习近平总书记在辽宁省沈阳市先后来到沈阳新松机器人自动化股份有限公司、皇姑区三台子街道牡丹社区，考察当地推动企业科技创新、加强基层党建和社区服务等情况。</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180934000451514657091.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180934000584083705283.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180935000117078300884.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180935000231149034410.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180935000343465459083.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180935000468221995065.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180935000571853730974.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180936000094929570672.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180936000221401045981.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180936000352210398860.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0818/MAIN202208180936000495638925892.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\